          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "হুঁশিয়ার — hũshiyār — \"watchful; on one's guard\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "রাতে বাইরে গেলে হুঁশিয়ার থেকো। rāte bāire gele hũshiyār theko. Be on your guard if you go out at night."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "হুঁশিয়ার (hũshiyār) is usually traced to Persian hushyār, alert or wide awake. As a single word it is also a warning: হুঁশিয়ার! Watch out!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
